{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quartermaster is an online co-op FPS with a strong emphasis on inventory management, where you must use a multitude of different weapons and traps to fight tons of dangerous robots.<br><br>Explore Neuraxis, a massive cyberpunk city, to complete objectives with up to 3 friends and reveal the truth behind this technological dystopia.<br><br>Strategize and keep only the most important items in your inventory. Utilize the cross-dimensional storage room for your items or your protection. Don\u2019t get backed into a corner with only a Medkit in hand! <br><br>Communicate with your teammates to get through objectives. To get through this city alive, you\u2019ll need to have good teamwork. Leave no robot behind! <br><br>Watch out for the hordes of enemies chasing you. You never know when an explosion could be right around the corner\u2026</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673980?t=1746682526","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3673980?t=1746682526","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673980/abd7051870d286f5b4a4dbd4299e7a1b5cc62d82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746682526","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673980/abd7051870d286f5b4a4dbd4299e7a1b5cc62d82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746682526","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Quartermaster is an online co-op FPS with a strong emphasis on inventory management, where you must use a multitude of different weapons and traps to fight tons of dangerous robots.<br><br>Explore Neuraxis, a massive cyberpunk city, to complete objectives with up to 3 friends and reveal the truth behind this technological dystopia.<br><br>Strategize and keep only the most important items in your inventory. Utilize the cross-dimensional storage room for your items or your protection. Don\u2019t get backed into a corner with only a Medkit in hand! <br><br>Communicate with your teammates to get through objectives. To get through this city alive, you\u2019ll need to have good teamwork. Leave no robot behind! <br><br>Watch out for the hordes of enemies chasing you. You never know when an explosion could be right around the corner\u2026</p>","developers":["Nathan Shturm","Josh Hall","Norman Zhu","Ani Sindhu"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Free To Play","id":"37"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3673980/3c175a8ff0a0df7b9cdaba4bc74d4c847a53e3b5/header.jpg?t=1746682526","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257133061,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133061/movie480.mp4?t=1746682524","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133061/movie_max.mp4?t=1746682524"},"name":"Quartermaster - Pre-Alpha Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257133061/13a719c951e94559a262ecfdacef045edb8d1524/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746682524","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133061/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746682524","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257133061/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746682524"}}],"name":"Quartermaster","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Core i5-6600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>St